== Description ==

**Customer Specific Pricing For Woocommerce** Show Specific Pricing in website . when your add to cart product than rule apply in your cart in your [Woocommerce](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WooCommerce) Website.

*📽 [Documentation](https://www.xeeshop.com/customer-specific-pricing-for-woocommerce/)*

> **Customer Specific Pricing For Woocommerce Plugin Features**
>
> * Easy Setup
> * Enable/disable plugin features
> * Add multiple rules for multiple products
> * Enable/disable option for rules
> * Apply rule for products and categories multiple selection
> * Apply rule for customers and roles
> * Fix price, increase fix price, decrease fix price, increase percentage, decrease percentage for rules
> * Min and max quantity options for rule
> * Start date and end date for apply rule
> * Add multiple rules button and remove button
> * Price and percentage option
> * Single pruduct page section all color customize options
> * Single pruduct page heading and rules text customize options
> * Single pruduct page heading text align customize options
> * Enable/disable display Rules In Single Product Page
